OL,4,CImmigration stats are down but will    
OL,5,Cthat be the end of the issue?          
OL,6,GNet migration falling to the tens of   
OL,7,Gthousands is a landmark moment in our  
OL,8,Gcollective national conversation about 
OL,9,Gimmigration over the last couple of    
OL,10,Gdecades.                               
OL,12,FThere is a simple reason for this. We  
OL,13,Fhave had years and years strewn with   
OL,14,Fthe litter of politicians promising to 
OL,15,Fcut net migration to under 100,000     
OL,16,Fannually.                              
OL,18,FBut it never happened, until now.      
